
# WINBD-PRO Admin

The admin panel is served by the backend at `/admin/`.

It requires a database user with `admin` or `superadmin` role. Create one with:

```bash
cd backend
npm run create-admin -- admin "A-strong-password-at-least-12-chars" admin@example.com
```

The panel uses the real admin API; it does not contain fake dashboard data.

